  "notes": "Fresh-state Nine Ball kick-out spot handshake. A coin and the credit button start a game with three balls in the trough and the serve is modelled. A ball is put in the left-lane kick-out hole (34) before object 5 is lit; each time the ROM fires a drop-target knock-down coil the scenario closes that target's switch, in the order coil 9 (object 7) to coil 15 (object 1), standing in for the target falling. A coil the ROM does not fire in that order ends the run with a timeout. When the kick-out fires the hole empties; when the ROM then pulses the eight-bank reset the scenario opens every target switch, standing in for the bank rising, and answers the knock-down coil that follows.",
